catflow 0.8
1. Read Text            announcement.md
2. <parallel two_takes>   text -> [text, text]
     1. Draft   (input:1)   Qwen3 8B; "Post, 280 chars max, no hashtags"

     2. Draft   (input:1)   Qwen3 8B; "Post, 280 chars max, playful"
3. Judge        (1,2)   Ministral 3B; "Which post lands better? tags: a, b"
   -> { a: 4 | b: 4 }
4. Ask Human            "Post this?"; timeout=12h; default=skip; tags: post, skip
   -> { post: 5 | skip: done }
5. Stage Post           outbox
